## JS Bridge Methods (SafeWebAppInterface)

| Method | Access | Risk |
|--------|--------|------|
| `masukDenganGoogle()` | Google OAuth | Auth flow exposure |
| `unduhEpisode(metaJson)` | File system | Potential path traversal |
| `bagikanGambar(base64, teks)` | Share intent | Data exfil vector |
| `showNotification(title, message)` | System notifications | Phishing |
| `getDeviceId()` | Android Settings | Device tracking |
| `getDataUsage()` | Network stats | Info leak |
| `getVersion()` | App version | Fingerprinting |
| `isNativeApp()` | Boolean | App detection |
| `adaKoneksi()` | Network state | Connectivity check |
| `infoPenyimpanan()` | Storage info | Disk usage leak |
| `setEmbedAktif(bool)` | UI state | Embed control |

