## Endpoint Summary (from assets/www)

- **Total endpoints mapped:** 243
- **Admin panel:** 90+ endpoints (db/read, db/write, storage, users, finance, events, upload)
- **Public API:** health, version, feed, leaderboard, teams, events, attestation, user profiles
- **Private (401):** /api/me, /api/check-premium, /api/party-jadwal, /api/donasi/config
- **Admin (401+DESKTOP_ONLY):** /api/admin/*

